<title>FINLAND: FINNISH HOME PRICES ROSE 3.6 PCT IN Q3 ON Q2 - SF.</title>
<headline>FINNISH HOME PRICES ROSE 3.6 PCT IN Q3 ON Q2 - SF.</headline>
<dateline>HELSINKI 1996-11-01</dateline>
<text>
<p>Finnish third quarter housing prices rose 3.6 percent compared to the second quarter, Statistics Finland (SF) said in a statement on Friday.  </p>
<p>In the capital area the prices rose 5.2 percent, and</p>
<p>elsewhere in Finland they rose 3.0 percent, it said.</p>
<p>Statistics Finland gave the following figures:</p>
<p>	     Average price (markka/m2)  Volume (Number of deals)</p>
<p>			     Q3	  Q2	   Q3	  Q2</p>
<p>Helsinki area	  7,495     7,127	1,252     1,335</p>
<p>Other areas	    4,671     4,535	3,120     2,836</p>
<p>Finland average	5,598     5,404	4,372     4,171</p>
<p>-- Helsinki newsroom +358-9-6805 0245</p>
